# Each visitor has the same three cues: v<id>_greet, v<id>_tested, v<id>_rejected.
# all three cues come from the same personality.
# Add v3_..., v4_... sets and raise Balance.DIALOGUE_SET_COUNT to match.
# Keep each line under ~100 characters, split longer speeches into several lines.

#-- v0

~ v0_greet
{{name}}: I wandered aimlessly trying to find some form of shelter.
{{name}}: Will you please let me stay? I have nowhere else to go, and… well…
{{name}}: I will help you as best I can.
=> END

~ v0_tested
{{name}}: Well, if you insist…
=> END

~ v0_rejected
{{name}}: How could you do this to someone?
=> END

#-- v1

~ v1_greet
{{name}}: Everyone is dead. Everyone is dead! Hahahaha.
{{name}}: Will you let me in? Nowhere left to go.
=> END

~ v1_tested
{{name}}: Guaaah do what you must
=> END

~ v1_rejected
{{name}}: Bye-bye!!
=> END

#-- v0

~ v2_greet
{{name}}: Rumor has been spreading of a safe location in this area…
{{name}}: Would you please let me stop by here for a moment?
{{name}}: It’s been forever since I’ve had a day of rest. I promise you I won’t stay for long.
=> END

~ v2_tested
{{name}}: If that’s what it takes
=> END

~ v2_rejected
{{name}}: I understand, I wish you the best of luck
=> END

~ v3_greet
{{name}}: I've been traveling for days, feels like walking in cirlces
{{name}}: Would you be so kind as to let me in?

~ v3_tested
{{name}}: If it gives you the peace of mind...

~ v3_rejected
{{name}}: ...
{{name}}: Pehaps the stars will guide me tonight
=> END

~ v4_greet
{{name}}: Those woods will trick'ya, eh?
{{name}}: If you're not careful, you might find yourself walking in circles
{{name}}: Listen, I'm very tired. Would 'preciate if u gave me a bed
{{name}}: Whaddaya say? eh?

~ v4_tested
{{name}}: Can't be too careful, eh?

~ v4_rejected
{{name}}: That's too bad, eh?
{{name}}: Ya have a nice day!
=> END

~ v5_greet
{{name}}: Dudeeee, im sooo tired
{{name}}: *yawnnnnnnn*
{{name}}: Waddaya say bro, lemme in? I make some killer brownies

~ v5_tested
{{name}}: Chilllllllll

~ v5_rejected
{{name}}: Brooooooooo, u gotta get a chill on for real
=> END
